    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Margaret gets 2 turns a cycle, so after 25 cycles she will kill you. Having a Skill or accessory that lets you endure will let you drag the fight out until 50 cycles. Also, if you have the Omnipotent Orb equipped she will kill you instantly, so don't do that. After getting her to half health she will heal, so you need to deal as much damage as possible. She is the hardest boss in the game, but she isn't impossible to beat. Make sure you are well prepared and you can do it."
    }
